# owlry — Walk with Great Minds
#
# With no variables set the app is the offline prototype: scripted councils,
# a library that lives in localStorage, an on-device mock account.
#
# Set both public client keys and the backend lights up (docs/council-backend.md):
# real accounts, cloud sync of councils / library / highlights, the shared
# feed, and — once council-chat is deployed with a GEMINI_API_KEY — councils
# written live for the reader's question. Both values are safe to ship;
# access is governed by row-level security.
#
# VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://<project-ref>.supabase.co
# VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=<anon key>
#
# Keep the scripted councils even with a backend (e.g. a demo build):
# VITE_COUNCIL_LIVE=off
#
# GEMINI_API_KEY is never a Vite variable: it lives only in Supabase
# (Edge Functions → Secrets), where council-chat / owl-chat read it.
